#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:4
msgid ""
"When provisioning an Instance, there are network and configuration "
"requirements to consider in order to successfully install the |morpheus| "
"Agent. Typically, when a VM Instance is still in the provisioning phase "
"long after the VM is up, the Instance is unable to reach |morpheus|. "
"Depending on the Agent install mode, it could also mean |morpheus| is "
"unable to reach the Instance."
msgstr ""
"Al aprovisionar una Instancia, hay requisitos de red y configuración a "
"considerar para instalar exitosamente the |morpheus| Agent. Typically, "
"when a VM Instance is still in the provisioning phase long after the VM "
"is up, the Instance is unable to reach |morpheus|. Dependiendo de the "
"Agent install mode, it could también mean |morpheus| is unable to reach "
"the Instance."

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:6
msgid ""
"The most common reason an Agent install fails is the provisioned Instance"
" cannot reach the |morpheus| Appliance via the Appliance URL set in "
"|AdmSet| over port 443. When an Instance is provisioned from |morpheus|, "
"it must be able to reach the |morpheus| appliance via the Appliance URL "
"or the Agent will not be installed."
msgstr ""
"The most common reason an Agent install fails is the provisioned Instance"
" cannot reach the |morpheus| Appliance via the Appliance URL set in "
"|AdmSet| over puerto 443. When an Instance is provisioned desde "
"|morpheus|, it debe ser able to reach the |morpheus| appliance via the "
"Appliance URL o the Agent will not be installed."

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:8
#, fuzzy
msgid ".. image:: /images/agent-7c9a2.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/agent-7c9a2.png"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Morpheus_Agent.rst:10
msgid ""
"In addition to the main Appliance URL in |AdmSet|, additional Appliance "
"URLs can be set per Cloud in the Advanced Options section of the Cloud "
"configuration modal when creating or editing a Cloud. When this field is "
"populated, it will override the main Appliance URL for anything "
"provisioned into that Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Además de la URL principal del Appliance in |AdmSet|, additional "
"Appliance URLs puede ser set per Cloud en la Advanced Options section de "
"la Cloud configuration modal when creating o editing a Cloud. Cuando este"
" campo está poblado, anulará la URL principal del Appliance para todo lo "
"aprovisionado en esa Nube."

